WEBVTT

00:11:57.823 --> 00:12:02.211
Prema tome, znamo da žene
danas ne koriste u potpunosti

00:12:02.211 --> 00:12:05.950
savremenu nauku i medicinu.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.601
Imamo sredstva,

00:12:07.601 --> 00:12:11.483
ali nam nedostaje
kolektivne volje i poleta.

00:12:11.483 --> 00:12:14.437
Žensko zdravlje je problem jednakih prava

00:12:14.437 --> 00:12:17.781
podjednako važan kao i jednaka zarada.

00:12:17.781 --> 00:12:19.965
To je pitanje kvaliteta

00:12:19.965 --> 00:12:23.120
i integriteta nauke i medicine.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.643
(Aplauz)